":0,"endColumn":28,"endLine":303,"line":293},"type":51,"typeText":"∀ (f : CauSeq.{0, 0} Complex fun x => Norm.norm.{0} x),\n  HasEquiv.Equiv.{1, 0} f (CauSeq.const.{0, 0} (fun x => Norm.norm.{0} x) (Complex.limAux f))","unsafe":false,"value":752,"source":{"code":"theorem equiv_limAux (f : CauSeq ℂ (‖·‖)) :\n    f ≈ CauSeq.const (‖·‖) (limAux f) := fun ε ε0 ↦\n  (exists_forall_ge_and\n  (CauSeq.equiv_lim ⟨_, isCauSeq_re f⟩ _ (half_pos ε0))\n        (CauSeq.equiv_lim ⟨_, isCauSeq_im f⟩ _ (half_pos ε0))).imp\n    fun _ H j ij ↦ by\n    obtain ⟨H₁, H₂⟩ := H _ ij\n    apply lt_of_le_of_lt (norm_le_abs_re_add_abs_im _)\n    dsimp [limAux] at *\n    have := add_lt_add H₁ H₂\n    rwa [add_halves] at this","start":293,"end":303},"axioms":["Classical.choice","Quot.sound","propext"]}